/* Conformance test for the public RSA sign/verify FFI (rktcrypto_rsa_sign_msg
   / rktcrypto_rsa_verify_msg), covering PKCS#1 v1.5 and PSS over SHA-256/384/
   512. This is a security trust-gate that previously had NO test at any tier.
   Interop KAT: signatures produced by python cryptography that our verify MUST
   accept (guards against an accept-all verify) + our-sign/our-verify roundtrip
   + tamper rejection (wrong message and mangled signature must both fail).
   Build: cc -O2 -I. -o t asm/tests/test_rsa.c <build>/.../librktcrypto.a */
